{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6e577eb0411561ea35ee96ce3eeca62baf87b57d5633df617f94132894a2487c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b1d351e5467585e44b89932e9c5b09ff358c2da54403773510af143626a0690",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，前天\n谢谢你光顾店里！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87dfc3f0cc628680ed4d3ef202828308b26aa9266565d392333dc8a6671872e",
      "text": "刚才武和涟来店里了，\n我也把那盆花给他们俩看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86f20df4e1de7fb572f1957b8bd34a1e67e6296aea4c801d805244faadb85d9",
      "text": "武说这样的装饰也挺不错，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd0c164de068046d9ed5147f53053c4a2a1db524e16477be5ef077ac94e2d06f",
      "text": "涟却说什么“这有什么意义”。\n哈哈，真像涟会说的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458f8715b6c381b97339977be7a4b2f2974abc4d1ad575373740523ac1392b46",
      "text": "那盆花，在熟客那里的\n评价也相当不错哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2fbc31784e6ba2bdd93d9d46f58ddd26ab73205d9c8f81d05a6b0976ff28be5",
      "text": "告诉他们原因之后，\n大家都为我打气，说广告拍摄要加油。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d3cdd80476f40e53602a40222485c40ccd6c1b18a9c7ecf78a20c45f153298b",
      "text": "一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b0fcb59005f2209fbcb80aa22b505f69f1eeca060d3853fbac97cf7c5c4db9",
      "text": "更有干劲了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:714b34b0e94d46eaa05af17369ab92e943c195716a306bed4f787f5559675a67",
      "text": "嗯！既然是作为广告播出，\n大家一定都能看到的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab951ea99a6acf4ec2ab4f6a454254fdeb66ab2509f6235307f0ab63bfabc85e",
      "text": "为了能拍出让支持我们的人都吃一惊的帅气影片，\n正式拍摄我会全力以赴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_b:2_4_039_03_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1664bcbb164dab7107f0ca899887dbfe1cdc0959a1bffe1a20ae587d658eba89",
      "text": "那我差不多挂了。\n欢迎下次再来店里坐坐哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
